 * See CASSANDRA-12126
 *
 *  - A Promised by {1, 2, 3}
 *  - A Acccepted by {1}
 *  - B (=>!A) Promised and Proposed to {2, 3}
 *  - Read from (or attempt C (=>!B)) to {1, 2} -> witness either A or B, not both
 */
